 rustc-1.95 (1.95.0+dfsg-26.04.0ubuntu6) resolute; urgency=medium
 .
   * Rebase local Ubuntu packaging onto upstream 1.95.0.
   * Keep bootstrap via rustc-1.94/cargo-1.94 from apt.
